WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.469
Week 35: Analysis, Argument, and Professional Listening. identify main idea and supporting detail defend an opinion summarize unfamiliar material

2
00:00:10.469 --> 00:00:37.100
Read for the situation. Un estudio propone ampliar un servicio público. Los datos muestran beneficios, aunque la muestra es limitada. La autora recomienda una prueba regional antes de adoptar la medida nacionalmente. A study proposes expanding a public service. The data show benefits, although the sample is limited. The author recommends a regional trial before adopting the measure nationwide.

3
00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:45.734
Read again for evidence. Identify who acts, what changes, when it happens, and which words establish the relationship between events.

4
00:00:45.734 --> 00:00:51.467
Reading activities. Reading activity 84; Reading activity 85

5
00:00:51.467 --> 00:00:59.354
Retell. Without looking back, give the main idea, three supporting details, and one reasonable inference in Spanish.

6
00:00:59.354 --> 00:01:30.049
Model language. Un estudio propone ampliar un servicio público. — A study proposes expanding a public service. Los datos muestran beneficios claros. — The data show clear benefits. Sin embargo, la muestra es limitada. — However, the sample is limited. La autora recomienda una prueba regional. — The author recommends a regional trial. Después sugiere adoptarlo nacionalmente. — Afterward she suggests adopting it nationally.

7
00:01:30.049 --> 00:01:39.947
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
